{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_retry", "label": "retry", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Die einfachste Schicht im Resilienz-Stack: keine Actors, kein Zustand, nur eine Promise-zurueckgebende Factory. Das Call-Level-Primitive gegenueber dem Actor-Level-Primitive BackoffSupervisor.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_retryoptions", "label": "RetryOptions", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "attempts ist Gesamt-Versuche, nicht Retries - attempts: 1 fuehrt die Factory genau einmal aus. Kein Jitter: das Delay ist deterministisch pro Versuch.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_shouldretry", "label": "shouldRetry", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Laeuft nach jedem fehlgeschlagenen Versuch ausser dem letzten; false schliesst kurz. Unterscheidet transiente Fehler (Netzwerk-Aussetzer, Rate-Limit, Lock-Contention) von permanenten (Validierung, Auth, 4xx), bei denen der naechste Versuch genauso fehlschlaegt. Auch der Weg, bei AbortError schnell zu scheitern.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_onattempt", "label": "onAttempt", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Feuert nach jedem fehlgeschlagenen Versuch inklusive dem letzten - fuer Counter pro Versuch, Tracing-Spans und Alerts auf 'uns sind die Retries ausgegangen'.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_sleep", "label": "sleep-Injection fuer Tests", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Echte Abstaende zu messen ist ein Flake mit Anlauf: ein 30-ms-setTimeout landet je nach Timer-Quantum und Maschinenlast zwischen etwa 19 ms und 200 ms - breit genug, dass ein gecapptes Delay von einem ungecappten nicht unterscheidbar ist. Mit einem ManualScheduler loest jeder Sleep auf, sobald die virtuelle Zeit ihn erreicht: der Zeitplan wird exakt geprueft und kostet keine Wall-Clock-Zeit.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_idempotency", "label": "Nicht-idempotente Operationen nicht blind retrien", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Gelingt der erste Call, geht aber die Response im Transit verloren, belastet der Retry die Karte erneut. Entweder die Operation idempotent machen (Request-ID, Idempotency-Key) oder seiteneffekt-behaftete Calls gar nicht retrien.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_maxdelayms", "label": "maxDelayMs als Overflow-Schutz", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "delayMs x factor^N laeuft ueber: bei attempts 50, delayMs 100, factor 2 ist Versuch 30 rund 1,6 Jahre Delay. Fuer factor > 1 immer maxDelayMs setzen.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_no_cancellation", "label": "retry weiss nichts ueber Cancellation", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Es gibt keine eingebaute Cancellation - ein laufender retry durchlaeuft alle Versuche. Ein AbortSignal muss in die Factory gereicht und via shouldRetry ausgewertet werden.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_retry", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_retryoptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_shouldretry", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_retryoptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_onattempt", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_retryoptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_sleep", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_retryoptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_maxdelayms", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_retryoptions", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_idempotency", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_retry", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_no_cancellation", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_shouldretry", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_sleep", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_backoff_policy_random_injection", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_retry", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_backoff_policy_exponentialbackoff", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_retry", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_futures_patterns_await_in_onreceive", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "resilience_stack_layers", "label": "Der Resilienz-Stack: Call-Level, Actor-Level und Per-Dependency-Schicht", "nodes": ["docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_retry_retry", "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_circuit_breaker_circuitbreaker", "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_backoff_supervisor_backoffsupervisor", "docs_src_content_docs_de_patterns_backoff_policy_backoffpolicy"], "relation": "form", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/patterns/retry.mdx"}]}